                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "This repository contains the full text format of the Dutch Abusive Language Corpus (DALC), which is composed of tweets in Dutch. The corpus is structured as follows:\n<br>\n<div class=\"indented\">\n<ul>\n <li> unique numeric id of the message </li>\n<li> full text message annonymised </li>\n <li> annotated data for abusive language </li>\n<li> annotated data for offensive language </li>\n</ul>\n</div>\nA full description of the dataset and accompanying data statement is available at  <a href=\"https://github.com/tommasoc80/DALC\">https://github.com/tommasoc80/DALC</a>."
                }
              }
            ]
